From a5154f73966e7bbf6f5b182e871f9b6d3d755f60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:16:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/29] debian: version for the Galaxy S10+ port

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 debian/changelog | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index d7381ca5..884db875 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,26 @@
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus7) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Default surface format 8/8/8/8: with the sizes unset libhybris ends
+    up with RGB_565 buffers and the transparent status bar shows black.
+  * ScreenGrab reports the requested format of each window.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:39:10 +0000
+
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus6) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Ask for an alpha channel for all Qt Quick windows: through libhybris
+    a transparent status bar was drawn black (alphaBufferSize 0).
+  * ScreenGrab: physical pixels, alpha size of each window.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:46:47 +0000
+
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus5) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * No drop shadow under the status bar (drew it black on the S10+).
+  * ScreenGrab: physical pixels, alpha size of each window.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:08:09 +0000
+
 plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus4) rolling; urgency=medium
 
   * Session lock only with Autolock on; the preloaded lock surface no
-- 
